    "sections": {
        "description": "Coach Mentor is a minimalist WordPress theme tailored for coaches, mentors, therapists, and even bloggers and writers. Ideal for startups, agencies, or mentoring businesses looking to boost their online presence and company website. Designed with Gutenberg and blocks, Coach Mentor ensures easy customization for affiliate marketers, portfolio creators, and companies of all sizes. It’s fully responsive, mobile friendly, and optimized for search engines, making it one of the fastest and best themes for SEO. Whether you're creating a landing page, blog, or ecommerce store, Coach Mentor is built to convert visitors into clients. Its simple, clean design is perfect for productivity and mentorship sessions, life coaches, and leadership development. From fitness to therapy, it offers flexibility for any niche, making it the top choice for blogging, writing, or agency use. With Coach Mentor, elevate your online brand with ease and confidence."
    },
